<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#141519;">Devices were signed out</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">On {{ revoked_at }}, {{ device_count }} of your devices {{ if device_count == "1" }}was{{ else }}were{{ end }} signed out of your {{ brand }} account. {{ reason_text }}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If this was you, there is nothing more to do.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If you do not recognise this, reset your password and review your signed in devices.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#c3e84f;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="{{ reset_link }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#141519;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Reset my password</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#4b4e4a;font-size:14px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
<a href="{{ reset_link }}" style="color:#141519;word-break:break-all;">{{ reset_link }}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;"><a href="{{ security_link }}" style="color:#141519;text-decoration:underline;">Review your signed in devices</a></p>
